  "answer": "```python\ndef stable_unique(values):\n    seen = set()\n    result = []\n    for v in values:\n        if (isinstance(v, (int, str)) and not isinstance(v, bool)):\n            key = (type(v).__name__, v)\n            if key not in seen:\n                seen.add(key)\n                result.append(v)\n        else:\n            result.append(v)\n    return result\n```",
